== ieee_16_16_not_of_clocked_sequence_s2
# evidence: derived
# 16.16 (p2 = not s2 with s2 = @(posedge clk) a ##2 b; the same verdicts for p3, the procedural form and
# the default-clock form: only the clock's source differs). Derived from 16.12.3.
# t0: a at 0, b low at 2: no match, not TRUE (pass at 2). t1: a low: TRUE at 1. t2: a at 2, b at 4: the
# sequence matches, not FALSE at 4. t3, t4: a low: TRUE.
property: not (a ##2 b)
clause: 16.16 16.12.3
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.16 s2/p2/p3, re-expressed
scope: attempt
sample  : 0 1 2 3 4
a       : 1 0 1 0 0
b       : 0 0 0 0 1
outcome : T T F T T
decided : 2 1 4 3 4
fail    : . . . . 1
pass    : . 1 1 1 1
pending : 0

== ieee_16_16_cover_of_s2_default_clock_c1
# evidence: derived
# 16.16 c1 (cover property of s2 = $rose(a) ##[1:5] b under the default clock): legal and covers at the
