== ieee_16_18_figure_16_17_clocking_block_sampled_value
# evidence: figure
# 16.18 Figure 16-17: a1/a2/a3/a4 (assert property of a, sampled in the clocking block) are equivalent and
# the figure shows one pass, at the third posedge, where a (high since before that edge, falling before the
# next) has the sampled value 1 and cb.a goes high only after the edge. Sample 0 = the figure's first
# posedge; sample 2 = the posedge with the arrow. Inputs as drawn: a low at posedges 1 and 2 (it rises after
# the second edge), high at 3, low at 4 and 5. The figure marks no failure; the failures at the low samples
# are the Boolean property's own rule (a low fails), not drawn.
property: a
clause: 16.18
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.18 Figure 16-17, re-expressed
sample  : 0 1 2 3 4
a       : 0 0 1 0 0
fail    : 1 1 . 1 1
pass    : . . 1 . .
pending : 0

